tity":"52e4a9235c23303521a961cc53e912bb23d3d3d29cfa590da44c2be382332360","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You fire a special voltaic shot with your steamgun(s) at a target for 100%% weapon damage as lightning.\n\t\tThe shot will release powerful electrical currents at up to %d nearby enemies. \n\t\tEach bolt does %0.2f lightning damage.\n\t\tThis talent does not use ammo as it is the ammo.\n\t\tBolt damage scales with Steampower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用蒸汽枪发射特殊弹药打击目标造成 100%% 闪电武器伤害。\n这将释放强大的电流，打击周围 %d 的敌人。\n每个闪电球造成 %0.2f 的闪电伤害\n这个技能不使用弹药\n闪电球伤害受蒸汽强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"332c35ef7072861bccd2ad696e393010a3abdf6cf39cff8e1f8e46607adb5c92","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b197c9a7db2712fa6cc862b483d0ece55ef2cf76d4d46ba001caa3700aa8d6d4","logical_entry_identity":"99f0bba81022ad785e42be8f3dcf018fb0e80e872d24e0115233024527413476","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Target is being assailed by an automated saw blade that cuts its flesh for %0.2f physical damage each turn%s. When the effect expires, the saw will explode for %0.2f fire damage and fly back to its source, pulling the target with it (up to %d tiles).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你被飞锯击伤，每回合受到 %0.2f 物理伤害 %s。仅当持续时间自然结束且施加者仍在场时，飞锯才会爆炸，造成 %0.2f 火焰伤害并飞回其来源；仅当你可被击退时，才会被拉向施加者（最多 %d 格）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06d3f81aeea3c9cc328a6c28d14ea93ca78ab3854e28226e1239d742fe0de9ce","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b19db57834d891ab1b7bcdd5a64cf6edd3fdef18c208b3a5b6a3e515ef1069c8","logical_entry_identity":"4858612ced19e905442a4938f4d9cef5d82b8b2b5008a0c3ca161013daec57f7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"hero","source_tag":"_t","target":"英雄"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c5d5998517d9881af9f0adfcc95d60816670dac53e64f5cb4177e254591c821","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b1b52b1a4b82153fb2d14a6037431a6de7295b6a5b9d47e21a0791180b8ca07d","logical_entry_identity":"06e704156319edfbeccada8293683cd829d0bbbb4d862a34f19cdf1c2fede977","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"New Class Evolution: #LIGHT_GREEN#Technomancer (Archmage)","source_tag":"_t","target":"新职业进阶：#LIGHT_GREEN#科技法师（元素法师）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3eb0d243174f8527a62ff979009bca334fa26316dd9741c02d7f69d6b825ae9d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b1d18dc309382c09dbb3932c960182895c6edd57d01a325e12a0b7aa8e46f229","logical_entry_identity":"87c63b82c2e196b7187dcf56d661c7fb981b065f45bbf8c515f0d00c3f798125","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Properly working and tempering a metal can make it harder than normal, and hold a sharper edge.","source_tag":"_t","target":"经过精心地回火锻造可以让金属比以前更加坚韧，拥有更加锐利的刀锋。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ace7c9b059e6ea26c6280ee45e2a9d111afe81f6729301c48dd1aae0e1078a84","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b1e20143b3ba9b84fa0e963d21d9908998b10501a7ce1c44c3c0d9a2aa64abe9","logical_entry_identity":"4d545369dc5fb20e0fde148a657a61321eaf53dbf9fb17ff3ffaa3a434950f78","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Spell damage done to it ripples in radius 4 doing 130% arcane damage.","source_tag":"_t","target":"其受到的法术伤害转化为波纹，对半径 4 内的所有目标造成等同于该伤害 130% 的奥术伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a4cf85ac3270f6d40b81151e740811b4c38a59302a42a517ac69a80a9b40fe1c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b1ea826fc14937f6b07982b4179e1705172c1141face1792c28b97abf374cc1e","logical_entry_identity":"e44ea86580efa5d0638173f395789e94b2e03667118daa8f5f85f8739510da52","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"I will!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我会的！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e94d28311ec6ee501a3f573db8bca04d3fe25864fe40f7f2385efd94db2977a8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b1f17f8c34e81de43e9df5ba4975998f37312fcfebe75eb5945210851890edc6","logical_entry_identity":"76d201b73e754a6760813de051bbae5caa908c9a76acf2ab9ecab212cec8bc9b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"hope","source_tag":"_t","target":"希望"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"03638ba44fa84208a6aadbeea6125568e1a3c4571f4bccd738b186bf5fe0c9f8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b21e1adecdcafcbe92b907178a41e4e346be2cb626dea974b1cce52a72e2c52e","logical_entry_identity":"ab4195c7b09cf250849ccc407b0014229ad4b1b5dab781bd0f09adba348b1c9f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"I... am %s, though I lack my original body my mind is bound to Garkul the Devourer. Garkul taught us to fight legends, and to flinch not from even the most desperate deed. Here and now I face you without fear or hesitation, for the spirit of Garkul burns within me. And in his name I will #{bold}#break#{normal}# you!","source_tag":"tformat","target":"我……名为%s，尽管失去了原本的躯体，我的精神仍与吞噬者加库尔紧密相连。加库尔教导我们挑战传奇，面对绝境也绝不退缩。此时此刻，我毫无畏惧与迟疑地面对你，因加库尔之意志在我体内燃烧。以他之名，我必将#{bold}#击垮#{normal}#你！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3728d044c956bc6cb302bf662ab428bbc597e9bc7bcab5004be10acd38eec74c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b221480b17cf5bacd6b6ed48ef736d74dc8a436c1dedf8a40618bfc94e36090f","logical_entry_identity":"55b79b8fe5ca6c8c976371ccd68cf69b742298ef5ba351ae9aee301ab58bb8b2","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"bottom of forest","source_tag":"entity name","target":"森林的底部"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d630f53b111f193d667598db03bf611bfda2de78a767e5c6a283f8c028c13ab","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b232162efdb573bcc6be4edeca5e25d836a758f6c45f4044515754706370daa1","logical_entry_identity":"0be5b993a47e7df677ce17e8a0379bbd564570de71545332108a6bc1650667db","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"These talents focus on cold and physical damage, summoning micro spiderbots to harass and pin their foes or protect themselves.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这一系技能专注于寒冷和物理伤害，召唤微型蜘蛛机器人，干扰并定身敌人，或是用于保护自己。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b275933e7b1799d5304be74c5a12a8134e8bfe574ff308d8371b5d52123ae75","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b2377e91d446dda8626339dd0df4f921da90cfb2c29a5c489d25faa2f69c6427","logical_entry_identity":"9865315463c2a87d1e95105e51c6406efa8403ac1a6eb7e6ef2abc732538d26d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +0 Constitution","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 力量，+3 敏捷，+0 体质"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"898a0c4521ebbc1cdf4cefb104417a68df986c5399a18ffe919af3ee8226ae1b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b238cde4a14d35f5ee4c2e84dcf9eab909b69b92b0b6f241dbf9f942aa039031","logical_entry_identity":"6268b56fd9408d63de8300e18293e4c571cfdf77dc19a0161808e055b73a967d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Infuse the mind, sacrifice the body but the Pride remains.","source_tag":"_t","target":"强化心智，牺牲肉体，但部落犹存。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a4878b9c90fecd144cfdbafdd9a428c33c8a3db8de81d2a50b9433de546edac0","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b239f65790f1c11e458f6921120aa430aa2928b47b9829eaf8269f55c76ddea0","logical_entry_identity":"f91d8cfdcac4fdd87b5465b9fbe97193ee8c02d8dda5028c27f0b2bcb103b84f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The saw embedded in #Target# flies back its source.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#身上的链锯飞回主人的方向。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2cd888d241cf801a29079e87575bae298d83616181c80a167d9abbcd01168fe3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b247acfed8f5ce3a5fe9410276fcffd13ac0184a3a12339a14900f4dd83c60be","logical_entry_identity":"1a19062486a6202e3db228b69c75078ee3fddb1abaccf51c77beaa8497bcb9ba","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Viral Injection","source_tag":"_t","target":"病毒注射"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"59d2893f5dfe5c8ffb8efe2d28f198cb3acc797c0284936c9c26bf2469d24f62","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"b24d120d1c6b67054879766b12648fd23fdf22bdb6c0ea3f88dee13cb813275e","logical_entry_identity":"cfa9c09510eff870c04a884597c96b382fabd3483096d9d71f7b1a67d9f0eac7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Activate the armour's active defense system.\n\t\tA flow of electricity covers your armour to attenuate the force of energy attacks while small steam engines move key pieces of the armour to attenuate physical attacks.\n\t\tAll damage except mind damage is reduced by a flat %d.\n\t\tIn addition the electric power of the armour sometimes leaks, each turn there is a 50%% chance to produce a electrical arc toward a foe, dealing %0.2f to %0.2f lightning damage to all foes in radius 1.\n\t\tThe effects increase with your Steampower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活护甲的主动防御系统。\n电流覆盖护甲，削弱能量攻击的威力；与此同时，小型蒸汽引擎会移动护甲的关键部件，以削弱物理攻击。\n除精神伤害外，所有伤害都会固定减少 %d 点。\n此外，护甲的电力有时会泄漏：每回合有 50%% 几率向一名敌人放出电弧，对其半径 1 内的所有敌人造成 %0.2f 至 %0.2f 点闪电伤害。\n效果随蒸汽强度提升。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a"}}